{"id": "3281227", "name": "חישוב נגזרת שנייה לפי כלל השרשרת - גרסה מעוצבת", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 2, "questiontext": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width: 980px; margin: 0 auto; font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; color: #1f2937; line-height: 1.65; text-align: right;\">\n<div style=\"background: #F4F1F5; border: 1px solid #D9D1DD; border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px 18px; margin-bottom: 18px;\">\n<div style=\"font-size: 19px; font-weight: bold; color: #4b1f6f; margin-bottom: 10px;\">כלל השרשרת מסדר שני</div>\n<p style=\"margin: 5px 0 10px 0;\">תהא <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(f:\\mathbb{R}^2\\to\\mathbb{R}\\)</span> פונקציה בעלת נגזרות חלקיות רציפות עד סדר שני. נגדיר</p>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: isolate; text-align: center; font-size: 17px; background: #FFFFFF; border-radius: 9px; padding: 10px 12px; line-height: 2;\">\n<div>\\(\\displaystyle u(s,t)=f(x(s,t),y(s,t))\\)</div>\n<div>\\(\\displaystyle x(s,t)={{CT:0}}\\)</div>\n<div>\\(\\displaystyle y(s,t)={{CT:1}}\\)</div>\n</div>\n<p style=\"margin: 10px 0 6px 0;\">נתבונן בנקודה <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\left(s_0,t_0\\right)=({{CT:2}},{{CT:3}})\\)</span>. מתקיים</p>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: isolate; text-align: center; font-size: 17px; background: #FFFFFF; border-radius: 9px; padding: 10px 12px; line-height: 1.9;\">\n<div>\\(\\displaystyle P=\\left(x\\left(s_0,t_0\\right),y\\left(s_0,t_0\\right)\\right)={{CT:4}}\\)</div>\n<div>\\(\\displaystyle f'_x(P)={{CT:5}},\\qquad f'_y(P)={{CT:6}}\\)</div>\n<div>\\(\\displaystyle f''_{xx}(P)={{CT:7}},\\qquad f''_{yy}(P)={{CT:8}}\\)</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"border: 1px solid #D9D1DD; border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px 18px; margin-bottom: 16px; background: #FFFFFF;\">\n<div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 9px; margin-bottom: 10px;\"><span style=\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 50%; background: #EEECEF; color: #4b1f6f; font-weight: bold;\">א</span> <span style=\"font-size: 18px; font-weight: bold; color: #4b1f6f;\">המקדמים המתקבלים מכלל השרשרת</span></div>\n<p style=\"margin: 5px 0 14px 0;\">חשבו בנקודה <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\left(s_0,t_0\\right)\\)</span> את שלושת הגדלים הבאים.</p>\n<div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px;\">\n<div style=\"background: #FAF9FB; border: 1px solid #EEECEF; border-radius: 10px; padding: 12px 14px;\">\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: isolate; display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap; font-size: 18px;\">\\(\\displaystyle A=(x'_s)^2+(x'_t)^2=(y'_s)^2+(y'_t)^2=\\) [[input:ans2]]</div>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: isolate; text-align: center; margin-top: 5px;\">[[validation:ans2]]</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background: #FAF9FB; border: 1px solid #EEECEF; border-radius: 10px; padding: 12px 14px;\">\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: isolate; display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap; font-size: 18px;\">\\(\\displaystyle B=x'_s y'_s+x'_t y'_t=\\) [[input:ans3]]</div>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: isolate; text-align: center; margin-top: 5px;\">[[validation:ans3]]</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background: #FAF9FB; border: 1px solid #EEECEF; border-radius: 10px; padding: 12px 14px;\">\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: isolate; display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap; font-size: 18px;\">\\(\\displaystyle C=x''_{ss}+x''_{tt}=y''_{ss}+y''_{tt}=\\) [[input:ans4]]</div>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: isolate; text-align: center; margin-top: 5px;\">[[validation:ans4]]</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"border: 1px solid #D9D1DD; border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px 18px; background: #FFFFFF;\">\n<div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 9px; margin-bottom: 10px;\"><span style=\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 50%; background: #EEECEF; color: #4b1f6f; font-weight: bold;\">ב</span> <span style=\"font-size: 18px; font-weight: bold; color: #4b1f6f;\">חישוב הסכום המבוקש</span></div>\n<p style=\"margin: 5px 0 12px 0;\">השתמשו בכלל השרשרת מסדר שני וחשבו את</p>\n<div style=\"background: #FAF9FB; border: 1px solid #EEECEF; border-radius: 10px; padding: 14px;\">\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: isolate; display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap; font-size: 18px;\">\\(\\displaystyle u''_{ss}\\left({{CT:2}},{{CT:3}}\\right)+u''_{tt}\\left({{CT:2}},{{CT:3}}\\right)=\\) [[input:ans1]]</div>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: isolate; text-align: center; margin-top: 5px;\">[[validation:ans1]]</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"text-align: right; line-height: 1.75; max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto; color: #1f2937;\">\n<div style=\"background: #F4F1F5; border: 1px solid #D9D1DD; border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px 18px;\">\n<div style=\"font-size: 18px; font-weight: bold; color: #4b1f6f; margin-bottom: 10px;\">פתרון מלא</div>\n<p style=\"margin: 6px 0;\">נסמן בקיצור <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(x=x(s,t)\\)</span> ו־<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(y=y(s,t)\\)</span>. מן ההגדרות מתקבל</p>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: isolate; text-align: center; background: #FFFFFF; border-radius: 9px; padding: 10px; margin: 8px 0 14px 0; line-height: 2;\">\n<div>\\(\\displaystyle x'_s=kx,\\qquad y'_s=ky\\)</div>\n<div>\\(\\displaystyle x'_t=-ky,\\qquad y'_t=kx\\)</div>\n<div>\\(\\displaystyle x''_{ss}=k^2x,\\qquad x''_{tt}=-k^2x\\)</div>\n<div>\\(\\displaystyle y''_{ss}=k^2y,\\qquad y''_{tt}=-k^2y\\)</div>\n</div>\n<p style=\"margin: 6px 0;\">לכן</p>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: isolate; text-align: center; background: #FFFFFF; border-radius: 9px; padding: 10px; margin: 8px 0 14px 0; line-height: 2;\">\n<div>\\(\\displaystyle A=x'_s^2+x'_t^2=y'_s^2+y'_t^2=k^2(x^2+y^2)\\)</div>\n<div>\\(\\displaystyle A={{CT:9}}\\)</div>\n<div>\\(\\displaystyle B=x'_s y'_s+x'_t y'_t=0\\)</div>\n<div>\\(\\displaystyle C=x''_{ss}+x''_{tt}=y''_{ss}+y''_{tt}=0\\)</div>\n</div>\n<p style=\"margin: 6px 0;\">כעת נשתמש בכלל השרשרת מסדר שני:</p>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: isolate; text-align: center; background: #FFFFFF; border-radius: 9px; padding: 10px; margin: 8px 0 10px 0; line-height: 1.9;\">\n<div>\\(\\displaystyle u''_{ss} =f''_{xx}x'_s^2+2f''_{xy}x'_s y'_s+f''_{yy}y'_s^2+f'_x\\,x''_{ss}+f'_y\\,y''_{ss} \\)</div>\n<div>\\(\\displaystyle u''_{tt} =f''_{xx}x'_t^2+2f''_{xy}x'_t y'_t+f''_{yy}y'_t^2+f'_x\\,x''_{tt}+f'_y\\,y''_{tt} \\)</div>\n</div>\n<p style=\"margin: 6px 0;\">בחיבור שתי הזהויות, איברי <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(f''_{xy}\\)</span>, <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(f'_x\\)</span> ו־<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(f'_y\\)</span> מתאפסים, ולכן</p>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: isolate; text-align: center; background: #FFFFFF; border-radius: 9px; padding: 10px; margin: 8px 0 10px 0; line-height: 1.9;\">\n<div>\\(\\displaystyle u''_{ss}+u''_{tt}=A\\bigl(f''_{xx}(P)+f''_{yy}(P)\\bigr) \\)</div>\n<div>\\(\\displaystyle u''_{ss}\\left({{CT:2}},{{CT:3}}\\right)+u''_{tt}\\left({{CT:2}},{{CT:3}}\\right) ={{CT:9}}\\bigl({{CT:7}}+({{CT:8}})\\bigr) ={{CT:10}} \\)</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>", "specificfeedback": "<p>[[feedback:prt2]] [[feedback:prt3]] [[feedback:prt4]] [[feedback:prt1]]</p>", "prtcorrect": "", "prtpartiallycorrect": "", "prtincorrect": "", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 24, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans2", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 20, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans3", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 14, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans4", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 14, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "prt1", "value": 0.6, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "tans1", "testoptions": null, "quiet": true, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-T", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"text-align: right;\"><strong>נכון.</strong> כלל השרשרת מסדר שני יושם כראוי.</div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-F", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"text-align: right;\">התוצאה הסופית אינה נכונה. חברו את נוסחאות כלל השרשרת עבור <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(u''_{ss}\\)</span> ו־<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(u''_{tt}\\)</span>, ואז השתמשו בערכים של <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(A,B,C\\)</span> שמצאתם.</div>"}}]}, {"name": "prt2", "value": 0.2, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans2", "tans": "tans2", "testoptions": null, "quiet": true, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt2-T", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"text-align: right;\">נכון. חישבתם כראוי את המקדם <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(A\\)</span>.</div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt2-F", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"text-align: right;\">המקדם <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(A\\)</span> אינו נכון. השתמשו בזהויות <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(x'_s=kx\\)</span>, <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(x'_t=-ky\\)</span> ובזהות המקבילה עבור <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(y\\)</span>.</div>"}}]}, {"name": "prt3", "value": 0.1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans3", "tans": "tans3", "testoptions": null, "quiet": true, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt3-T", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"text-align: right;\">נכון. האיברים המעורבים מתבטלים.</div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt3-F", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"text-align: right;\">בדקו שוב את <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(x'_s y'_s+x'_t y'_t\\)</span>. שימו לב לסימן של <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(x'_t\\)</span>.</div>"}}]}, {"name": "prt4", "value": 0.1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans4", "tans": "tans4", "testoptions": null, "quiet": true, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt4-T", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"text-align: right;\">נכון. סכומי הנגזרות השניות של רכיבי ההעתקה מתאפסים.</div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt4-F", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"text-align: right;\">בדקו את <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(x''_{ss}+x''_{tt}\\)</span> ואת <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(y''_{ss}+y''_{tt}\\)</span>. בכל אחד מהם שני האיברים אמורים להתבטל.</div>"}}]}], "qvnames": ["Pdisp", "acoef", "bcoef", "bestlength", "ccoef", "finalans", "fxp0", "fxxp0"